  "title": "Beef Pho",
  "description": "This beef pho features a rich bone and oxtail broth seasoned with onion, ginger, anise, and cinnamon ladled over rice noodles and thin-sliced meat.",
  "authors": [
    "Lett101"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:09:44-04:00",
